= Vladimir Zenzinov

Zenzinov (1880-1953) is a member of the Central Committee and the party's organiser. In 1918 he will sit in the Directory, and be arrested in Kolchak's coup.

- @action
- @root: Return to main

@action
title: Party Machine
subtitle: Zenzinov builds the party's organisation and its membership.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.members += 20 * Q.mem_scale; RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2, workers: 1}); RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 1, -4);
!}

Zenzinov opened a dozen new provincial committees and put the old ones in order. The party's membership is growing.

